 gside fellow members.\n\nThe experience unfolds at an easy\, social pace: 
 a thoughtfully curated\, family-style menu paired with subtle conversation
  prompts to spark connection and keep dialogue flowing. Enjoy a table of p
 astries\, fresh fruit\, and parfaits to begin\, followed by your choice of
  entrée and generous sides\, with Bloody Marys and mimosas available thro
 ughout.\n\nIt’s a refined\, convivial take on brunch at The ’House—w
 elcoming\, engaging\, and designed to bring together those who appreciate 
 great conversation and even better company.\n\n*Tickets are $65 per person
 \, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancellations within 48 h
 ours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will be charged in full. Please
