DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 1 spo
 t left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/eve
 nts/182103\n\nA simple set of kitchen tools can be the difference between 
 a space and a home.\n\nJoin The ‘Quin Impact Fund for a hands-on volunte
 er experience in partnership with Household Goods\, where you will assembl
 e Kitchen Starter Sets for individuals and families transitioning into sta
 ble housing. Together\, you will unpack\, sort\, and thoughtfully build es
 sential kits - each one filled with everyday items that make it possible t
 o cook\, gather\, and begin again.\n\nHousehold Goods furnishes more than 
 2\,500 homes each year\, yet the demand for basic kitchen essentials remai
 ns constant. These starter sets - simple\, practical\, and deeply impactfu
 l - help ensure that every home begins with the tools needed for daily lif
 e.\n\nMembers are invited to contribute by donating new or gently used kit
 chen items or supporting purchases through a curated Amazon wish list ahea
 d of the event. A meaningful opportunity to give back\, connect\, and play
  a small part in helping someone build a home from the ground up.\n\n*This
  event is complimentary and reserved for members only. For any questions 
 regarding donation items\, please contact The ‘Quin Impact Fund team at�
 �impact@thequin.com.\n\nShop the Amazon Wishlist here.
