BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-169178@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260519T130000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T150000
SUMMARY: 90 Minutes of Innovation: Leadership\, Governance and the Long Vie
 w 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are on Waitlis
 t\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/169178\n\n1:00PM Pro
 gram\, 2:30PM Networking\nWhat does it take to guide institutions\, advise
  CEOs\, and shape strategy at the highest levels across decades of transfo
 rmation?\n\nIn the latest edition of 90 Minutes of Innovation*\, John Wern
 er—venture capitalist\, MIT lecturer\, and *Forbes* AI columnist—sits 
 down with David Mussafer\, Chairman of Advent International and one of th
 e most influential leaders in global private equity.\n\nWith a career span
 ning decades\, Mussafer has helped build Advent into one of the world’s
  top ten private equity firms\, headquartered here in Boston\, while also 
 advising companies and serving on boards across industries. Drawing from 
 the arc of his life’s work\, the conversation will weave together person
 al insights and professional milestones\, offering a perspective that sit
 s at the intersection of capital\, governance\, and long-term value creati
 on—where the biggest decisions are often the least visible.\n\nTogether\
 , they will explore what great companies and leadership teams have in comm
 on\, how boards actually function—and how they must evolve—the role of
  private equity in building\, not just acquiring\, companies\, and how lea
 ders navigate uncertainty\, cycles\, and long-term strategy. The conversat
 ion will also draw on lessons from decades of investing across sectors and
  geographies.\n\nExpect a thoughtful\, behind-the-scenes conversation abou
 t how decisions get made at the highest levels—where governance meets gr
 owth\, and strategy meets execution.\n\nFrom boardrooms to global markets�
 ��one stage\, one conversation\, not to be missed.\n\n*This event is compl
 imentary and reserved for members only. Light bites and refreshments will 
 be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/169178
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
