 t\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/1
 84140\n\nJoin us for a lively Bingo-Themed Member Mixer. Enjoy 5–6 fast-
 paced rounds of traditional bingo\, each lasting 10–15 minutes\, with pl
 enty of chances to win and connect. After each round\, winners will switch
