SUMMARY:Art Tour: Masterworks in Print 
LOCATION:Meet in The Lobby
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent U
 RL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/176379\n\nJoin ‘Quin Collect
 ion Curator Kate Chertavian for a print-focused art tour. The discussion w
 ill begin in the Lobby with a closer look at Julie Mehretu’s spectacular
  copper-plate etching\, Six Bardos: Luminous Appearance\, and Cy Twombly�
 �s silkscreen from the landmark On the Bowery series.\n\nThe conversation 
 will explore a wide range of printmaking techniques—including screenprin
 t\, woodcut\, and lithography—featuring works by artists such as Robert 
 Mangold\, Jasper Johns\, and Louise Bourgeois.\n\nThe tour will also offer
  insights into a remarkable new addition to the ‘Quin’s collection: Cl
 aude Monet’s Champ d’Iris à Giverny.\n\n*This event is complimentary 
 and reserved for members only.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/176379
