BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-183090@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260704T150000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260704
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260707
SUMMARY:'Venture: Wimbledon
LOCATION:Offsite
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Venture - Travel\nPrice: $12850.47 per person\nAva
 ilability: 1 spot left\nStatus: Available\nTime: 3 PM – 12 PM\nEvent URL
 : https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/183090\n\nAn Exclusive Seat at T
 ennis' Most Iconic Stage. Experience the Prestige of Wimbledon.\nMore than
  a visit to London\, this is an invitation to one of sport’s most rarefi
 ed worlds - Wimbledon... where tradition\, precision\, and quiet luxury co
 nverge on perfectly kept grass courts.\n\nYour weekend centers on Sunday a
 t the All England Lawn Tennis Club\, where members will take their place o
 n Centre Court with coveted Debenture tickets\, among the most exclusive s
 eats in global sport. As the Championships enter the fourth round\, the at
 mosphere sharpens: the field narrows\, the stakes heighten\, and the game 
 reveals its most compelling drama. From this vantage point\, members will 
 witness the world’s finest players in matches that will define the traje
 ctory to the finals.\n\nBetween play\, move at your own pace through the g
 rounds - where champagne is poured with ease\, strawberries and cream rema
 in a ritual\, and every detail reflects Wimbledon’s singular blend of he
 ritage and refinement. This is not simply spectating\; it is participation
  in a cultural institution\, experienced as it was intended.\n\nCurated wi
 th intention\, this is an insider experience of Wimbledon at its most elec
 tric\, shared in the company of those who appreciate it most.\n\nDay One |
  Saturday\, July 4th\n\nYour journey begins with your arrival in London\, 
 where you will be welcomed to The Kensington Hotel\, a refined townhouse k
 nown for its polished discretion and residential charm.\n\nOnce checked in
 \, take a moment to unwind from your travels - whether relaxing in the hot
 el’s inviting drawing rooms or stepping out to explore the surrounding n
 eighborhood at your leisure. The afternoon is yours to ease into the rhyth
 m of the city or connect with fellow ‘Quin members as the experience uno
 fficially begins.\n\nIn the evening\, gather for a 'Quin Member welcome di
 nner hosted by former-Londoner - our very own Managing Director\, Matthias
  Kiehm at The Audley Public House. The Audley is a proper neighborhood Pub
  where history and contemporary art collide. Here\, amid thoughtfully rest
 ored interiors and a convivial atmosphere\, members will be reintroduced t
 o fellow fans of the sport over a beautifully prepared dinner while antici
 pating the next days matches.\n\nDay Two | Sunday\, July 5th\n\nYour secon
 d day begins with a seamless departure from The Kensington Hotel as you ma
 ke your way to Wimbledon\, with travel arrangements thoughtfully coordinat
 ed for ease and comfort.\n\nUpon arrival at the All England Lawn Tennis Cl
 ub on "Middle Sunday\," you will have the full day to experience the Gentl
 emen's and Ladies' Singles Fourth Round at your own pace. With Debenture t
 icket(s) in hand\, enjoy prime seating on Centre Court - where the field n
 arrows and the tournament’s momentum becomes palpable. Your tickets also
  provide access to No. 1 Court and the outer courts\, allowing you to move
  fluidly between matches and take in the breadth of play across the ground
 s.\n\nThroughout the day\, you will have access to the Debenture Holders�
 � Lounge and its collection of private bars and dining venues. Whether pau
 sing for a leisurely lunch\, a glass of champagne\, or a moment of respite
  overlooking the courts\, the experience is yours to shape as you wish.\n\
 nFollowing the conclusion of play\, return to London in the early evening.
  Keeping dynamic match times in mind\, the day concludes with a relaxed la
 te-evening group dinner\, in a stylish yet comfortable setting to unwind a
 nd reflect before returning to The Kensington Hotel for a well-deserved ni
 ghts rest.\n\nDay Three | Monday\, July 6th\n\nYour final morning begins a
 t a relaxed pace with breakfast at The Kensington Hotel. Enjoy a quiet sta
 rt to the day - whether over a leisurely meal or a final moment of calm in
  the hotel’s inviting surroundings.\n\nFollowing breakfast\, departures 
 will take place on your own schedule - whether returning home\, or staying
  on for an independent extension to the trip. As you make your way home\, 
 carry with you the memories of a weekend defined by exceptional access\, t
 houghtful curation\, and the shared experience of Wimbledon at its most co
 mpelling.\n\nClassic Room | Single Occupancy\n\nClassic Room at The Kensin
 gton Hotel | Two Twin Beds with Breakfast Included\n\nOne Wimbledon Debe
 nture Ticket to the Gentlemen's and Ladies' Singles Fourth Round\, includi
 ng Centre Court seating and the Debenture's Holders' Lounge with its colle
 ction of private bars and dining venues.\n\nTwo curated group dinners\, in
 cluding a welcome dinner at The Audley Public House.\n\n$7\,950\n\nClassic
  Room | Double Occupancy\n\nClassic Room at The Kensington Hotel | Queen B
 ed with Breakfast Included\n\nTwo Wimbledon Debenture Tickets to the Gentl
 emen's and Ladies' Singles Fourth Round\, including Centre Court seating a
 nd the Debenture's Holders' Lounge with its collection of private bars and
  dining venues.\n\nTwo curated group dinners\, including a welcome dinner 
 at The Audley Public House.\n\n$13\,750\n\nPlease note the price of airfar
 e is not included in the ticket price. Members and their guests are respon
 sible for booking their own flights. For the smoothest arrival experience\
 , we recommend flying into London Heathrow Airport (LHR) located less than
  an hour by car from The Kensington Hotel.\n\n* Reservations are non-refun
 dable and non-transferable. Please note that all bookings are subject to t
 he terms and conditions outlined in the final confirmation materials inclu
 ding your sign-off on a standard liability waiver.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/183090
CATEGORIES:‘Venture - Travel
END:VEVENT
